# L §5.14.3 How a settlement leg counts: "moving the booked amount to where V puts it (konto to konto2) settles a change
# of places alone": a settlement leg between two of the leg's `to` places runs both ways and counts 0, so the
# remainder is δ - 0 = 0 and nothing is listed. L5_14_3_settle_place_change.test's model with bank[r1] moving
# 5 000.00 PLN from konto to konto2: konto2 holds 5 000.00 PLN; konto took the five wages of January to May (pay_to is
# konto but in March, whose wage was booked to konto before move_acct was known) and gave 5 000.00: 20 000.00 PLN (b).
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source act "act"
source bank_export "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place konto2: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input pay_to: key accounts
input bank: observed
def net[m in months]: money PLN = wage_amt at start_of(m)
def dest[m in months]: key accounts = pay_to at start_of(m)

move wage[m in months]: wages
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to dest[m] amount net[m]

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  pay_to = konto "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[konto2] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version move_acct
  cite act
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-05-01
  replace pay_to = konto2 "aneks"

version transfer_back
  cite bank_export
  governs 2026-05
  known 2026-05-20
  covers konto2 2026-05-15..2026-05-15
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-05-15, kind: wages, leg cash from konto to konto2 amount 5 000.00 PLN, fulfils: adjustments[wage[2026-03].cash, move_acct]) "line 1"

ask b: bal(konto2, 2026-05-31), bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
=== expect
b: (5 000.00 PLN, 20 000.00 PLN)
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-05]
  cut 2026-10-20
